            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Scriberman 1.0.8</h2>
<h3>Fixes</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Copying a full transcript now includes speaker labels and timestamps, matching the exported text.</li>
  <li>The microphone picker now excludes devices that cannot capture audio, preventing silent recordings caused by selecting speakers.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
